    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνθάλπ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>warm thoroughly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.974c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Salubr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>warm</i> or <i>soothe</i> by cheering words, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηδέ μ᾽ . . ξύνθαλπε μύθοις ψευδέσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					685
				</span></i>
			.</div>
